#==============================================================================================
#
#   table_formatting_context_4 - Layout::TableFormattingContext: border conflict resolution
#                                and the grid's cells by coordinate
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/TableFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1276-1702) and the
#       BorderConflictFinder of TableFormattingContext.h: the border conflict resolution of the
#       collapsing border model (https://www.w3.org/TR/CSS22/tables.html#border-conflict-resolution),
#       which gives each cell the winning border of every side among the cells, rows, row
#       groups, columns, column groups and the table meeting there; the content height of a
#       cell's rows; and the cells by coordinate and the columns' originating cells.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2020, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
#       SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
#
